# Backend

- One service, one Postgres database `appdb_<service>_<staging|production>`.
- Public HTTP is `/api/v1/...` on that service’s port. Ingress maps those paths.
- Static Linux binaries: `CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64`.
- Handler tests live next to code (`services/<svc>/handlers/*_test.go`). Spec/catalog tests live under `tests/unit/<svc>/`.
- Protected routes return 401 without a valid JWT/cookie. Do not skip auth to make a test pass.
- Do not copy another service’s tables into this database to unblock a test.
